<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia June palm oil output 785,000t - Ivan Wong.</title>
<headline>Malaysia June palm oil output 785,000t - Ivan Wong.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's palm oil output in June was estimated at 785,000 tonnes against 790,640 tonnes in May, private forecaster Ivan Wong said on Monday.</p>
<p>Wong put palm oil stocks at the end of June at 795,000 tonnes, compared with the Palm Oil Registration and Licensing Authority's (PORLA) 711,841 tonnes at end-May.</p>
<p>Exports in June were estimated at 595,000 tonnes against 626,606 tonnes in May.</p>
</text>
